<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8685] Incorrect size for switch segment record </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8685</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have invariant that switch segment record should have the size of one byte.&lt;br/&gt;
Although, in the current implementation, size calculation with overhard for storing CRC and WAL pointer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In current implementation, we can suddenly stop WAL iteration which may result in random data store corruptions or missing updates on node recovery.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
